      "description": "与账号、密码同宽的46px原生下拉框；选项为角色与演示姓名，管理员同名去重。运行页更新下方演示部门，保留输入，提交中禁用选择器。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-role-field\"><label class=\"ds-role-label\" for=\"ds-login-role\">演示角色</label><div class=\"ds-role-control\"><select class=\"ds-login-role-select\" id=\"ds-login-role\" aria-describedby=\"ds-role-hint\"><option value=\"admin\">系统管理员</option><option value=\"sales\" selected>外贸业务员 · 陈明</option><option value=\"doc\">单证员 · 王芳</option><option value=\"fin\">财务人员 · 赵倩</option><option value=\"boss\">业务主管 · 周建国</option></select><span class=\"ds-role-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"ds-role-hint\" id=\"ds-role-hint\" aria-live=\"polite\">演示部门：外贸一部</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-role-field{width:100%;max-width:470px;font-family:inherit;color:var(--text,#211d38)}.ds-role-label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:9px}.ds-role-control{position:relative}.ds-login-role-select{width:100%;height:46px;padding:0 44px 0 14px;border:1px solid #8b809f;border-radius:var(--radius-control,8px);background:#faf9fd;color:var(--text,#211d38);font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;appearance:none;outline:none;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color var(--duration-fast,140ms),background-color var(--duration-fast,140ms)}.ds-login-role-select:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:#6542d9}.ds-login-role-select:focus,.ds-login-role-select:focus-visible{border-color:var(--primary,#6542d9);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(101,66,217,.16)}.ds-login-role-select:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:wait}.ds-role-chevron{position:absolute;right:14px;top:50%;display:flex;transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(90deg);color:var(--text-sub,#6b647d);pointer-events:none}.ds-role-chevron svg{width:16px;height:16px}.ds-role-hint{font-size:12px;margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--text-sub,#6b647d);min-height:18px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-login-role-select{transition:none}}"
